   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 261,
   "en": "Looks like even a <Super Robot> could fit inside easily.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 262,
   "en": "Azuki",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 263,
   "en": "What on earth could be in there...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 264,
   "en": "No Lamaris have come out so far.@I'd guess it has something to do with them...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 265,
   "en": "Miles",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 266,
   "en": "...We'll leave the interior survey to the Hiryu.@Have it advance as far as possible. This ship stays@here as the rear guard.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 267,
   "en": "Roger.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 268,
   "en": "What the hell is that...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 269,
   "en": "There are Kaana types inside...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 270,
   "en": "So many... All the Lamaris Kaana captured so far@were gathered here.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 271,
   "en": "So what was that dumb clown plannin' to do with 'em?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 272,
   "en": "I wonder if those devices are extracting@something from the Kaana.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 273,
   "en": "Then what's that in the center...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 274,
   "en": "...I have a seriously bad feeling about this.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 275,
   "en": "Me too... The negative will just keeps getting stronger.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 276,
   "en": "Eun, get me Commander Miles.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 277,
   "en": "Eun",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 278,
   "en": "Roger... You're connected. Go ahead.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 279,
   "en": "Commander, are you seeing this footage?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 280,
   "en": "Yes. Are those devices preserving the Lamaris@Kaana... no, cultivating them?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 281,
   "en": "If that were possible, wouldn't Debudedabide have had@no need to bring Lamaris to Shinjuku?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 282,
   "en": "Then what do you say those devices are?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 283,
   "en": "I can't reach a conclusion yet,@but I believe we should destroy them at once.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 284,
   "en": "I'll ask the Joint Chiefs for instructions.@All units stand by on alert until ordered.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 285,
   "en": "Please wait.@At least let the units be ready to destroy them@immediately...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 286,
   "en": "I didn't hear you repeat that, Lieutenant Colonel.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 287,
   "en": "...Yes, sir.@All strike force units will stand by on alert@until ordered. Eun, relay it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 288,
   "en": "Roger.@Dragon 2 to all units. Stand by on alert until ordered.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 289,
   "en": "Tch, this again?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 290,
   "en": "He's just checking the Joint Chiefs' mood.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 291,
   "en": "Keep doing that every time things get hairy,@and you're gonna get burned.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 292,
   "en": "Message from Steel 2!@An object is diving fast from directly above@the structure! Number: one!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 293,
   "en": "Can the Hagane intercept?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 294,
   "en": "It won't make it! It's coming inside!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 295,
   "en": "Crystal Dragoon",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 296,
   "en": "That is far enough.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 297,
   "en": "Roa",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 298,
   "en": "Crystal Dragoon...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 299,
   "en": "You're late!@I'll give you the same treatment as that fatso!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 300,
   "en": "I cannot allow you to have@the results of his experiment.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 301,
   "en": "What do you mean, the results of his experiment?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 302,
   "en": "Learn the answer at the cost of your lives.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 303,
   "en": "Bring it on! Don't you budge from there!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 304,
   "en": "I need not be told.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 305,
   "en": "What!?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 306,
   "en": "Kota, the Crystal Dragoon is buying time.@Destroy every Lamaris Kaana container before@Debudedabide's experiment produces results.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 307,
   "en": "Got it! Major Kai, I'm chargin' in!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 308,
   "en": "I'll pretend I didn't hear that.@All units, intercept the Crystal Dragoon!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 309,
   "en": "This feeling...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 310,
   "en": "The Kaana types are activating!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 311,
   "en": "Are they reacting to our will?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 312,
   "en": "So it has begun.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 313,
   "en": "Wh-What the heck is that?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 314,
   "en": "I-Is that a Lamaris too...?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 315,
   "en": "Wh-What a giant...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 316,
   "en": "The Kaana types merged even further!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 317,
   "en": "The experiment has succeeded.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 318,
   "en": "You bastard, what're you plannin'@to do, creatin' a thing like that?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 319,
   "en": "You need not know. Here, you will...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 320,
   "en": "Nn...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 321,
   "en": "That big lug doesn't care who it hits?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 322,
   "en": "Looks like it can't be controlled@like the Lamaris Kaana.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 323,
   "en": "Aah, Lamaris!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 324,
   "en": "It can multiply its own kind?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 325,
   "en": "Couldn't it just be separating@the individuals that fused?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 326,
   "en": "Even so,@that makes it a huge carrier with combat ability.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 327,
   "en": "And if it turns out to be a Lamaris factory on top@of that, that's pretty nasty, isn't it?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 328,
   "en": "If something like that reached a major city...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 329,
   "en": "Lieutenant Irm,@we can't just let a thing like that go!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 330,
   "en": "I know. Surely they'll order an attack now.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 331,
   "en": "Commander, every second counts.@We're the only ones who can respond right now.@Please authorize an attack.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 332,
   "en": "I-It can't be helped. Authorized.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 333,
   "en": "Eleve 1 to all units! Commence attack!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 334,
   "en": "You got it!@I'm sendin' these Lamaris to rest for good, right here!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 335,
   "en": "At this rate...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 336,
   "en": "Twelve o'clock, spatial distortion@inside the structure!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 337,
   "en": "!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 338,
   "en": "Knew I was right to come, too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 339,
   "en": "Skull Knight!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 340,
   "en": "Perfect, I'll bury you here too!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 341,
   "en": "Hmph, I didn't come here today@to tangle with you lot.@Chestnut, hold 'em off.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 342,
   "en": "Acknowledged.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 343,
   "en": "Can you use your transfer art once more?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 344,
   "en": "Yeah. All right, let's go.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 345,
   "en": "Th-That bastard!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 346,
   "en": "Sean",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 347,
   "en": "Captain, all enemy readings inside the structure@have disappeared.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 348,
   "en": "In the end, did we play right into the hands@of the Dark Brain's remnants...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 349,
   "en": "That... we can't say yet.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 350,
   "en": "...Units needing repair or resupply, return at once.@All others, maintain full alert.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 351,
   "en": "Understood, Captain.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 352,
   "en": "Skull Knight, Crystal Dragoon,@and the giant Lamaris: readings lost!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 353,
   "en": "Damn, to let them get away like that...!@All strike force units, sweep the remaining Lamaris!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 354,
   "en": "If that thing can create Lamaris, is that what@the Dark Brain's remnants are after too?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 355,
   "en": "The bigger they get, the uglier they look.@If there's a next time... well, I'd rather not see it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 356,
   "en": "We can't let that thing out of here!@We'll purify it with our own power!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 357,
   "en": "That Lamaris isn't normal...@If we can't stop it here, it'll be a disaster!@It's up to us!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 358,
   "en": "An even bigger Lamaris, huh?@It's just like the <Einst>.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 359,
   "en": "How much malice is in that Lamaris...!@We have to purify it here, no matter what!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 360,
   "en": "Monsters makin' monsters!@Think about the guys who gotta clean up after you!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 361,
   "en": "That size is way beyond the Kaana types!@We gotta throw everything we've got at it!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 362,
   "en": "With a body that huge...@its attack power may be high, but it can't be fast.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 363,
   "en": "With that many Kaana types merged into one,@it's like their ugliness got concentrated too...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 364,
   "en": "It's not hard to imagine what happens if it gets out...@We'll stop it here, no matter what!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 365,
   "en": "Fatso and his pals were gatherin' Lamaris@just to make somethin' like that?!@Screw that!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 366,
   "en": "After showin' us somethin' like that?!@Don't think you're gettin' off without answerin'!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 367,
   "en": "I told you.@Learn the answer at the cost of your lives.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 368,
   "en": "Like hell, you moron!@I can't hear the answer if I'm dead!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 369,
   "en": "So that's what they were doing with@the Lamaris Kaana they captured.@No wonder they were trying to gather so many.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 370,
   "en": "That is all you will learn.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 371,
   "en": "Just as I thought, something rotten...@Every Lamaris here will be wiped out!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 372,
   "en": "I will not allow it.@I must obtain the experiment's results.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 373,
   "en": "Showin' up now of all times! Were ya plannin'@to steal Debudedabide's glory?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 374,
   "en": "He was the one obsessed with glory.@And so he lost to you. Foolish.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 375,
   "en": "Because you drove out those who were here,@the experiment could be carried out. I thank you.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 376,
   "en": "We didn't fight the <Baral>@for your sake!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 377,
   "en": "...Message from the Joint Chiefs. Regarding our earlier@inquiry, they authorize an attack on the target.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 378,
   "en": "Only now...?@I'll report the results of the battle directly, later.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 379,
   "en": "(Now, how am I going to explain this...?)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 380,
   "en": "Commander, may I offer my opinion?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 381,
   "en": "What's that?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 382,
   "en": "I believe we should survey under the ruins of the@<Garden of Baral>. Since Debudedabide used <Yokijin>,@a plant or something similar may remain.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 383,
   "en": "...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 384,
   "en": "I'd like permission, if only to find out why@a pyramid was built in this place.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 385,
   "en": "Then the Joint Chiefs' judgment... no, that's too slow.@As part of the full alert duty, I'll approve it@on my own authority.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 386,
   "en": "(The commander made that call...?)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 387,
   "en": "XO, name the units best suited@to an underground survey.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 388,
   "en": "Sir. I'd say KoRyuOh and the Grungust Type 3,@with their large drills.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 389,
   "en": "Then pick a pilot for the Type 3@and send them underground.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 390,
   "en": "Hagane - Hangar",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 391,
   "en": "Damn... We beat Fatso,@but Skull Knight got the better of us.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 392,
   "en": "Where'd those guys take@that big Lamaris?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 393,
   "en": "The Dark Iron Castle, I bet.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 394,
   "en": "But we still don't know where that is...@They've left us with a real headache.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 395,
   "en": "Did Debudedabide know this was@the <Garden of Baral>'s ruins@when he built that pyramid?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 396,
   "en": "Probably, yeah.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 397,
   "en": "It hasn't been that long since@the Sealing War ended.@How did he build something that big...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 398,
   "en": "Well, ain't it magic?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 399,
   "en": "Huh?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 400,
   "en": "Hmm, can't totally rule that out.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 401,
   "en": "Oh my, isn't that...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 402,
   "en": "So Bullet and the others are back.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 403,
   "en": "Lieutenant Kyosuke, we've finished the@underground survey and returned.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 404,
   "en": "Good work. Did you report to the bridge?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 405,
   "en": "Yes, just now.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 406,
   "en": "So, how did it go?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 407,
   "en": "Just as the captain predicted, there was a space@that seems to have been a Yokijin hangar,@with dozens of wrecks scattered around.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 408,
   "en": "Only Yokijin? What about Choukijin wrecks?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 409,
   "en": "We didn't find any.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 410,
   "en": "The inside was heavily damaged, and no one was there...@It was like a graveyard.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 411,
   "en": "Is that why we couldn't sense any of@the will that lingered in this place?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 412,
   "en": "This is just my opinion... but I think the malice@that had stagnated in the Garden of Baral's ruins@was absorbed by the Lamaris.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 413,
   "en": "Meaning this place was perfect@for creating a giant Lamaris?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 414,
   "en": "Most likely.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 415,
   "en": "That's sickening. Let's just smash the pyramid@and that underground graveyard already.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 416,
   "en": "Sooner or later, that order will come.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 417,
   "en": "Now that Debudedabide is gone, if we destroy@that pyramid, will Skull Knight and the others@be unable to create giant Lamaris anymore?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 418,
   "en": "...I'd like to hope so.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 419,
   "en": "But rather than driving us out of the pyramid,@Skull Knight made recovering@the giant Lamaris the priority.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 420,
   "en": "Maybe getting just one of those@is enough for them.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 421,
   "en": "If so, what do they intend to do?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 422,
   "en": "Ain't they just gonna make@a whole bunch of Lamaris?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 423,
   "en": "I get the feeling that's not all...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 424,
   "en": "Then what is it?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 425,
   "en": "Maybe they mean to make that giant Lamaris@grow even more...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 426,
   "en": "And then what?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 427,
   "en": "...I don't know that much.@I just hope it's not too late@the next time Skull Knight and the others make a move...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 428,
   "en": "Commander, a message from the Joint Chiefs.@The 13th Special Operations PT Unit is rushing@to our current position...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 429,
   "en": "That unit will take over surveying and guarding@the Garden of Baral's ruins, and the Steel Dragons@are to return to Izu Base.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 430,
   "en": "To Izu...? I thought we'd be given the mission@of destroying the pyramid.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 431,
   "en": "Has the next operation been decided?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 432,
   "en": "There's been no word on that.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 433,
   "en": "...I see. Captain, you heard it.@Begin preparations to return to Izu.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 434,
   "en": "Heat source detected at six o'clock, range 5!@Looks like someone is fighting!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 435,
   "en": "What? Can't you even tell if they're friendly?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 436,
   "en": "Interference from <EA>@makes details impossible to determine!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 437,
   "en": "Could it be the 13th Special Operations PT Unit?",
